From 9bd11457e380a0eaed8cc96e032270daab0f0f34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenTTD P0 Instrumentation <p0-instrumentation@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:31:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] port003: add partial tape identity journal

Validate the canonical tape identity header against the frozen v1 shape, stream exact partial tape framing and records, and durably retain the journal for the independent C17 finalizer.

This patch does not integrate replay or sample gameplay state. Later patches supply the prevalidated command stream and authoritative command/tick records.
